When creating UI:

Prefer Magic UI components:

- Animated Beam
- Border Beam
- Bento Grid
- Marquee
- Aurora Text
- Meteors
- Shine Border
- Animated List

Use them only when they improve UX.

Do not overuse effects.

Priority:

1. Readability
2. Performance
3. Consistency
4. Animation
